) in calendar days, minus days_suspended","source":"PARIVESH appraisal history","vintage":"live"},"appraisal.days_suspended":{"label":"Days suspended","unit":"days","kind":"duration","definition":"Days during which the portal had automatically delisted the proposal and it was later revived. Nothing is pending with the authority during such an interval, so it is excluded from the time to decision.","formula":"merged intervals whose status is delisted_by_system, in whole calendar days - the same basis as the duration it is subtracted from","source":"PARIVESH appraisal history","vintage":"live"},"appraisal.filed_on":{"label":"First filing date","unit":"date","kind":"date","definition":"The date of the earliest act the workflow engine records for this proposal. Distinct from the register's own submission date, which moves forward on re-submission; durations are measured from this one.","formula":"earliest step date","source":"PARIVESH appraisal history","vintage":"live"},"appraisal.query_rounds":{"label":"Rounds of questions","unit":"count","kind":"count","definition":"Number of times the authority sought Essential or Additional Details from the proponent.","formula":"count of steps whose status is eds_raised or ads_raised","source":"PARIVESH appraisal history","vintage":"live"},"appraisal.steps_recorded":{"label":"Recorded steps","unit":"count","kind":"count","definition":"Number of dated acts the workflow engine holds for this proposal.","formula":"count of steps","source":"PARIVESH appraisal history","vintage":"live"},"appraisal.phase_days":{"label":"Days in a phase","unit":"days","kind":"duration","definition":"Elapsed days a proposal spent in one phase of the passage from filing to decision. Overlapping steps within a phase are merged before summing. Phases may overlap each other because the source runs steps concurrently, so these do not sum to the total elapsed time and are not a breakdown of it.","formula":"union of [start, end] intervals of the steps in the phase","source":"PARIVESH appraisal history","vintage":"live"}}}